    },
    {
      "id": "r014",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "20.2.2.2: se permite tomar E_s = 200 000 MPa para barras no pretensadas.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 688
    },
    {
      "id": "r015",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "E_s := 200000 MPa",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 736
    },
    {
      "id": "r016",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "eps_ty := f_y/E_s =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 784
    },
    {
      "id": "r017",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "22.2.2.1: deformación útil máxima del hormigón en compresión.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 832
    },
    {
      "id": "r018",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "eps_cu := 0.003",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 880
    },
    {
      "id": "r019",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "━━ DATOS · FACTORES φ ━━",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 944
    },
    {
      "id": "r020",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Tabla 21.2.1: φ = 0,75 para cortante, en una y en dos direcciones.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 992
    },
    {
      "id": "r021",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "phi_v := 0.75",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1040
    },
    {
      "id": "r022",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Tabla 21.2.2(f): φ = 0,90 si es controlada por tracción (se verifica en §5).",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1088
    },
    {
      "id": "r023",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "phi_f := 0.90",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1136
    },
    {
      "id": "r024",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "━━ DATOS · GEOMETRÍA Y ARMADURA ━━",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1200
    },
    {
      "id": "r025",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "c_col := 40 cm",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1248
    },
    {
      "id": "r026",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "B := 220 cm",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1296
    },
    {
      "id": "r027",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "h := 55 cm",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1344
    },
    {
      "id": "r028",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "A_zap := B^2 = m^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1392
    },
    {
      "id": "r029",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Tabla 20.5.1.3.1: vaciado contra el suelo y en contacto permanente → 75 mm.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1440
    },
    {
      "id": "r030",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "rec := 7.5 cm",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1488
    },
    {
      "id": "r031",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Frontera declarada: el diámetro nominal de la barra y cuántas van.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1536
    },
    {
      "id": "r032",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "d_b := 1.8 cm",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1584
    },
    {
      "id": "r033",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "n_b := 9",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1632
    },
    {
      "id": "r034",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "A_b := pi*d_b^2/4 = cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1680
    },
    {
      "id": "r035",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "A_s := n_b*A_b = cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1728
    },
    {
      "id": "r036",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Altura útil: se DERIVA. Malla en dos capas ortogonales, así que el promedio de",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1776
    },
    {
      "id": "r037",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "las dos es h − rec − d_b (una a −d_b/2 de la cara inferior de la malla, la otra",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1824
    },
    {
      "id": "r038",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "a −3d_b/2). No se redondea: de d cuelgan V_c, φM_n, λ_s y ℓ_d a la vez.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1872
    },
    {
      "id": "r039",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "d := h - rec - d_b = cm",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1920
    },
    {
      "id": "r040",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "━━ DATOS · SUELO Y CARGAS DE SERVICIO ━━",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1984
    },
    {
      "id": "r041",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Frontera declarada: la presión admisible del informe de mecánica de suelos.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2032
    },
    {
      "id": "r042",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "q_a := 2.0 kgf/cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2080
    },
    {
      "id": "r043",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "P_D := 60 tonf",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2128
    },
    {
      "id": "r044",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "P_L := 30 tonf",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2176
    },
    {
      "id": "r045",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "━━ 0 · LOS COEFICIENTES: LA COLUMNA MÉTRICA DE ACI 318 ━━",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2240
    },
    {
      "id": "r046",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "ACI 318 se publica en dos ediciones y sus coeficientes empíricos no son",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2288
    },
    {
      "id": "r047",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "conversión exacta uno del otro. El PDF en disco es la edición SI: manda ésa.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2336
    },
    {
      "id": "r048",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "fconv := sqrt(1 MPa/(1 kgf/cm^2)) =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2384
    },
    {
      "id": "r049",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "rfck := sqrt(f_c/(1 kgf/cm^2))*kgf/cm^2 = kgf/cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2432
    },
    {
      "id": "r050",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Tabla 22.5.5.1(c): el 0,66 que multiplica √f'c en MPa.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2496
    },
    {
      "id": "r051",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "k_1d := 0.66*fconv =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2544
    },
    {
      "id": "r052",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "22.5.5.1.1: el piso 0,083 y el tope 0,42 de la misma tabla.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2592
    },
    {
      "id": "r053",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "k_piso := 0.083*fconv =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2640
    },
    {
      "id": "r054",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "k_tope := 0.42*fconv =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2688
    },
    {
      "id": "r055",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Tabla 22.5.5.1(a): el 0,17 de la expresión clásica, sin cuantía ni tamaño.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2736
    },
    {
      "id": "r056",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "k_clas := 0.17*fconv =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2784
    },
    {
      "id": "r057",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Tabla 22.6.5.2: (a) 0,33 · (b) 0,17 · (c) 0,083.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2832
    },
    {
      "id": "r058",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "k_2a := 0.33*fconv =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2880
    },
    {
      "id": "r059",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "k_2b := 0.17*fconv =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2928
    },
    {
      "id": "r060",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "k_2c := 0.083*fconv =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2976
    },
    {
      "id": "r061",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Tabla 25.4.2.3, columna de barras No. 19 y menores: el 2,1 del denominador.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3024
    },
    {
      "id": "r062",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "k_ld := 2.1*fconv =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3072
    },
    {
      "id": "r063",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "━━ 1 · DIMENSIONAMIENTO EN PLANTA (13.3.1.1, cargas de SERVICIO) ━━",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3136
    },
    {
      "id": "r064",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "13.3.1.1: el área en planta se proporciona con cargas no mayoradas contra la",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3184
    },
    {
      "id": "r065",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "presión admisible del suelo.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3232
    },
    {
      "id": "r066",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "A_req := (P_D + P_L)/q_a = m^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3280
    },
    {
      "id": "r067",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "q_serv := (P_D + P_L)/A_zap = kgf/cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3328
    },
    {
      "id": "r068",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "u_q := q_serv/q_a =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3376
    },
    {
      "id": "r069",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "u_q <= 1 =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3424
    },
    {
      "id": "r070",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "━━ 2 · PRESIÓN MAYORADA DE DISEÑO (Tabla 5.3.1, Ec. 5.3.1b) ━━",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3488
    },
    {
      "id": "r071",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "El peso propio de la zapata no solicita la sección: lo equilibra el suelo justo",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3536
    },
    {
      "id": "r072",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "debajo. Solo la carga que baja por la columna genera corte y momento.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3584
    },
    {
      "id": "r073",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "N_u := 1.2*P_D + 1.6*P_L = tonf",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3632
    },
    {
      "id": "r074",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "q_u := N_u/A_zap = tonf/m^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3680
    },
    {
      "id": "r075",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "vol := (B - c_col)/2 = cm",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3728
    },
    {
      "id": "r076",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "━━ 3 · CORTE EN UNA DIRECCIÓN (13.2.7.2 → 8.5.3.1.1 → 22.5) ━━",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3792
    },
    {
      "id": "r077",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "13.2.7.2 mide la sección crítica desde la cara de la columna; 8.4.3.2 la ubica",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3840
    },
    {
      "id": "r078",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "a d de esa cara.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3888
    },
    {
      "id": "r079",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "V_u1 := q_u*B*(vol - d) = tonf",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3936
    },
    {
      "id": "r080",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Sin estribos, A_v < A_v,min → Tabla 22.5.5.1 fila (c), con λ_s y ρ_w explícitos.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3984
    },
    {
      "id": "r081",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "rho_w := A_s/(B*d) =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4032
    },
    {
      "id": "r082",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "crho := rho_w^(1/3) =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4080
    },
    {
      "id": "r083",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Ec. (22.5.5.1.3): factor de efecto de tamaño, con d en mm.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4128
    },
    {
      "id": "r084",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "lam_s := min(1, sqrt(2/(1 + (d/(1 mm))/250))) =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4176
    },
    {
      "id": "r085",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "v_bruto := k_1d*lam_s*lambda*crho*rfck = kgf/cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4240
    },
    {
      "id": "r086",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "22.5.5.1.1: V_c no se toma mayor que 0,42λ√f'c·b·d, y NO hace falta tomarlo",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4288
    },
    {
      "id": "r087",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "menor que 0,083λ√f'c·b·d. Las dos excepciones al piso —(a) tracción axial neta,",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4336
    },
    {
      "id": "r088",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "(b) 18.6.5.2 o 18.7.6.2.1— no aplican a esta zapata.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4384
    },
    {
      "id": "r089",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "v_piso := k_piso*lambda*rfck = kgf/cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4432
    },
    {
      "id": "r090",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "v_tope := k_tope*lambda*rfck = kgf/cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4480
    },
    {
      "id": "r091",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "v_c1 := min(max(v_bruto, v_piso), v_tope) = kgf/cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4528
    },
    {
      "id": "r092",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "piso_manda := v_bruto < v_piso =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4576
    },
    {
      "id": "r093",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "V_c1 := v_c1*B*d = tonf",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4624
    },
    {
      "id": "r094",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "Rd_V1 := phi_v*V_c1 = tonf",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4672
    },
    {
      "id": "r095",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "u_V1 := V_u1/Rd_V1 =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4720
    },
    {
      "id": "r096",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "Rd_V1 >= V_u1 =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4768
    },
    {
      "id": "r097",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "━━ 3.1 · DE DÓNDE VIENE LA CAÍDA DE CAPACIDAD ━━",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4832
    },
    {
      "id": "r098",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Expresión clásica de la fila (a), 0,17λ√f'c·b·d, la del «código antiguo»:",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4880
    },
    {
      "id": "r099",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "Rd_clas := phi_v*k_clas*lambda*rfck*B*d = tonf",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4928
    },
    {
      "id": "r100",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "u_clas := V_u1/Rd_clas =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4976
    },
    {
      "id": "r101",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "La expresión nueva sin efecto de tamaño (λ_s = 1), ya con el piso aplicado:",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5024
    },
    {
      "id": "r102",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "v_ls1 := max(k_1d*lambda*crho*rfck, v_piso) = kgf/cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5072
    },
    {
      "id": "r103",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "Rd_ls1 := phi_v*v_ls1*B*d = tonf",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5120
    },
    {
      "id": "r104",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "u_ls1 := V_u1/Rd_ls1 =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5168
    },
    {
      "id": "r105",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Y lo que el efecto de tamaño agrega encima: la caída bruta contra la que el",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5216
    },
    {
      "id": "r106",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "piso de 22.5.5.1.1 deja pasar.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5264
    },
    {
      "id": "r107",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "V_c1bruto := v_bruto*B*d = tonf",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5312
    },
    {
      "id": "r108",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "Rd_bruto := phi_v*V_c1bruto = tonf",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5360
    },
    {
      "id": "r109",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "u_bruto := V_u1/Rd_bruto =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5408
    },
    {
      "id": "r110",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "caida_expr := 1 - Rd_ls1/Rd_clas =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5456
    },
    {
      "id": "r111",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "caida_lams_bruta := 1 - Rd_bruto/Rd_ls1 =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5504
    },
    {
      "id": "r112",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "caida_lams_real := 1 - Rd_V1/Rd_ls1 =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5552
    },
    {
      "id": "r113",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "━━ 4 · PUNZONAMIENTO — CORTE EN DOS DIRECCIONES (22.6.4.1 y Tabla 22.6.5.2) ━━",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5616
    },
    {
      "id": "r114",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "22.6.4.1(a): perímetro crítico a d/2 de la cara de la columna.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5664
    },
    {
      "id": "r115",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "b_o := 4*(c_col + d) = cm",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5712
    },
    {
      "id": "r116",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "V_u2 := q_u*(A_zap - (c_col + d)^2) = tonf",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5760
    },
    {
      "id": "r117",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Tabla 22.6.5.2: el menor de (a), (b) y (c). β = 1 por columna cuadrada;",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5808
    },
    {
      "id": "r118",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "22.6.5.3: α_s = 40 para columna interior.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5856
    },
    {
      "id": "r119",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "beta_c := 1",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5904
    },
    {
      "id": "r120",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "alpha_s := 40",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5952
    },
    {
      "id": "r121",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "v_2a := k_2a*lam_s*lambda*rfck = kgf/cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6000
    },
    {
      "id": "r122",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "v_2b := k_2b*(1 + 2/beta_c)*lam_s*lambda*rfck = kgf/cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6048
    },
    {
      "id": "r123",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "v_2c := k_2c*(2 + alpha_s*d/b_o)*lam_s*lambda*rfck = kgf/cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6096
    },
    {
      "id": "r124",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "v_c2 := min(v_2a, v_2b, v_2c) = kgf/cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6144
    },
    {
      "id": "r125",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "Rd_V2 := phi_v*v_c2*b_o*d = tonf",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6192
    },
    {
      "id": "r126",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "u_V2 := V_u2/Rd_V2 =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6240
    },
    {
      "id": "r127",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "Rd_V2 >= V_u2 =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6288
    },
    {
      "id": "r128",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "━━ 5 · FLEXIÓN (Tabla 13.2.7.1 y 22.2/22.3) ━━",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6352
    },
    {
      "id": "r129",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Tabla 13.2.7.1: con columna de hormigón, M_u se toma en la CARA de la columna.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6400
    },
    {
      "id": "r130",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "M_u := q_u*B*vol^2/2 = tonf*m",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6448
    },
    {
      "id": "r131",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "22.2.2.4.1: bloque rectangular equivalente de 0,85f'c sobre una altura a = β1·c.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6496
    },
    {
      "id": "r132",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "a_bl := A_s*f_y/(0.85*f_c*B) = cm",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6544
    },
    {
      "id": "r133",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "c_na := a_bl/beta_1 = cm",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6592
    },
    {
      "id": "r134",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "Rd_M := phi_f*A_s*f_y*(d - a_bl/2) = tonf*m",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6640
    },
    {
      "id": "r135",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "u_M := M_u/Rd_M =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6688
    },
    {
      "id": "r136",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "Rd_M >= M_u =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6736
    },
    {
      "id": "r137",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "21.2.2: controlada por tracción si ε_t ≥ ε_ty + 0,003 (no el 0,005 fijo de 318-14).",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6784
    },
    {
      "id": "r138",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "eps_t := eps_cu*(d - c_na)/c_na =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6832
    },
    {
      "id": "r139",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "eps_lim := eps_ty + 0.003 =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6880
    },
    {
      "id": "r140",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "eps_t >= eps_lim =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6928
    },
    {
      "id": "r141",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "━━ 6 · REFUERZO MÍNIMO Y DISTRIBUCIÓN (13.3.3.1 → 8.6.1.1) ━━",
      "pageBreak": true,
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6992
    },
    {
      "id": "r142",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "13.3.3.1 remite la zapata aislada de dos direcciones al Cap. 8, y 8.6.1.1 pide",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7040
    },
    {
      "id": "r143",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "A_s,min = 0,0018·A_g — la misma cuantía de retracción y temperatura de 24.4.3.2.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7088
    },
    {
      "id": "r144",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "A_smin := 0.0018*B*h = cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7136
    },
    {
      "id": "r145",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "A_s >= A_smin =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7184
    },
    {
      "id": "r146",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "El acero que la flexión pediría, para ver cuál de los dos manda. Dos pasadas",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7232
    },
    {
      "id": "r147",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "bastan: el brazo casi no se mueve entre una y otra.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7280
    },
    {
      "id": "r148",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "A_s0 := M_u/(phi_f*f_y*0.95*d) = cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7328
    },
    {
      "id": "r149",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "a_req := A_s0*f_y/(0.85*f_c*B) = cm",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7376
    },
    {
      "id": "r150",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "A_sreq := M_u/(phi_f*f_y*(d - a_req/2)) = cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7424
    },
    {
      "id": "r151",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "min_manda := A_smin > A_sreq =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7472
    },
    {
      "id": "r152",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "13.3.3.2: en zapatas CUADRADAS el refuerzo va uniforme en todo el ancho, en las",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7520
    },
    {
      "id": "r153",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "dos direcciones (13.3.3.3 es la de las rectangulares, con banda central γ_s·A_s).",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7568
    },
    {
      "id": "r154",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "sep := (B - 2*rec - d_b)/(n_b - 1) = cm",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7616
    },
    {
      "id": "r155",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "━━ 7 · DESARROLLO DE LA BARRA (Tabla 25.4.2.3 y 25.4.2.1) ━━",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7680
    },
    {
      "id": "r156",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Condición de confinamiento, segunda opción de la tabla: separación libre ≥ 2d_b",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7728
    },
    {
      "id": "r157",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "y recubrimiento libre ≥ d_b. Con eso entra la columna del 2,1.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7776
    },
    {
      "id": "r158",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "sep_libre := sep - d_b = cm",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7824
    },
    {
      "id": "r159",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "sep_libre >= 2*d_b =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7872
    },
    {
      "id": "r160",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "rec >= d_b =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7920
    },
    {
      "id": "r161",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "ψ_t = 1 (barra inferior), ψ_e = 1 (sin epóxico), ψ_g = 1 (Grado 420), λ = 1.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7968
    },
    {
      "id": "r162",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "psi_t := 1",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8016
    },
    {
      "id": "r163",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "psi_e := 1",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8064
    },
    {
      "id": "r164",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "psi_g := 1",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8112
    },
    {
      "id": "r165",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "l_d := f_y*psi_t*psi_e*psi_g/(k_ld*lambda*rfck)*d_b = cm",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8160
    },
    {
      "id": "r166",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "25.4.2.1: además ℓ_d ≥ 300 mm.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8208
    },
    {
      "id": "r167",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "l_d >= 300 mm =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8256
    },
    {
      "id": "r168",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Longitud disponible: el volado menos el recubrimiento de borde.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8304
    },
    {
      "id": "r169",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "l_disp := vol - rec = cm",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8352
    },
    {
      "id": "r170",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "u_ld := l_d/l_disp =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8400
    },
    {
      "id": "r171",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "l_disp >= l_d =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8448
    },
    {
      "id": "r172",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "━━ 8 · DETALLADO ━━",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8512
    },
    {
      "id": "r173",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "13.3.1.2: la altura útil del refuerzo inferior debe ser al menos 150 mm.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8560
    },
    {
      "id": "r174",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "d >= 150 mm =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8608
    },
    {
      "id": "r175",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "16.3.4.1: espigas de al menos 0,005·A_g de la columna a través de la junta.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8656
    },
    {
      "id": "r176",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "A_dow := 0.005*c_col^2 = cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8704
    },
    {
      "id": "r177",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "━━ RESUMEN: QUÉ GOBIERNA ━━",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8768
    },
    {
      "id": "r178",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "`gobierna` se recalcula al cambiar cualquier dato: dice qué estado límite manda.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8816
    },
    {
      "id": "r179",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "u_max := max(u_q, u_V1, u_V2, u_M, u_ld) =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8864
    },
    {
      "id": "gob",
      "kind": "program",
      "src": "gobierna :=\nif u_max == u_q\n  return \"presión de contacto en servicio (13.3.1.1)\"\nelse if u_max == u_V1\n  return \"corte en una dirección (Tabla 22.5.5.1c)\"\nelse if u_max == u_V2\n  return \"punzonamiento (Tabla 22.6.5.2)\"\nelse if u_max == u_M\n  return \"flexión (22.3.1)\"\nelse\n  return \"desarrollo de la barra (Tabla 25.4.2.3)\"",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8912
    },
    {
      "id": "r180",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "La presión fija la PLANTA. El canto lo fija el mayor de los estados de la sección:",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9136
    },
    {
      "id": "r181",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "u_canto := max(u_V1, u_V2, u_M) =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9184
    },
    {
      "id": "gobc",
      "kind": "program",
      "src": "gob_canto :=\nif u_canto == u_V1\n  return \"corte en una dirección\"\nelse if u_canto == u_V2\n  return \"punzonamiento\"\nelse\n  return \"flexión\"",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9232
    },
    {
      "id": "r182",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "u_max <= 1 =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9392
    },
    {
      "id": "esq",
      "kind": "image",
      "src": "/esquemas/zapata-aislada.svg",
      "w": 660,
      "h": 440,
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9440
    },
    {
      "id": "r183",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "━━ 9 · CONTRASTE CON EL POST — cada número publicado, contra el calculado ━━",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9920
    },
    {
      "id": "r184",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Tolerancia: media unidad del último dígito publicado.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9968
    },
    {
